/-!
# A209354

Triangular array:  T(n,k) = number of partitions of n for which (maximal term)-(minimal term)=k, if 0<=k<n, and T(n,n)=1.

The 95 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A209354

